<%- include('header') %><section class="section admin-page"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">SALON MANAGEMENT</div><h1>Your salon, <em>at a glance.</em></h1></div><form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="button outline">Sign out</button></form></div><div class="admin-stats"><div><strong><%= stats.total %> / 100</strong><span>Coupons issued</span></div><div><strong><%= stats.recent %></strong><span>Applications in 24 hours</span></div><div><strong>₹100–₹150</strong><span>New spin awards</span></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Customer leads</h2><a href="/admin/export" class="button outline small">Export CSV ↓</a></div><p>WhatsApp: <%= whatsappConfigured?'configured':'not configured — confirmations remain queued' %>. “Accepted” means Meta accepted the request, not confirmed delivery. Unknown requests need checking in Meta before any manual resend.</p><form method="get" class="search"><input name="q" value="<%= q %>" placeholder="Search name, mobile or coupon" aria-label="Search leads"><button class="button small">Search</button></form><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Customer</th><th>Service / preferred visit</th><th>Claimed (IST)</th><th>Coupon</th><th>Expiry</th><th>Status</th><th>WhatsApp</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><% leads.forEach(l=>{ %><tr><td><strong><%= l.name %></strong><br><a href="tel:+91<%= l.mobile %>"><%= l.mobile %></a></td><td><%= l.service %><br><small><%= l.preferred_visit_date?visitDate(l.preferred_visit_date):'Within '+l.timeframe+' days (legacy)' %></small></td><td><%= timestamp(l.created_at) %></td><td><%= l.code %><br><small>₹<%= l.discount %> <%= l.award_kind==='spin'?'won':'maximum (legacy)' %></small></td><td><%= date(l.expires_at) %></td><td><span class="pill"><%= l.used?'Used':l.expires_at<Date.now()?'Expired':'Available' %></span></td><td><span class="pill"><%= l.whatsapp_status||'Not requested' %></span><br><small><%= l.whatsapp_error||'' %></small><% if(l.whatsapp_status==='failed' && l.expires_at>Date.now()){ %><form method="post" action="/admin/whatsapp/<%= l.id %>/retry"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="button outline small">Retry WhatsApp</button></form><% } %></td><td><form method="post" action="/admin/lead/<%= l.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="used" value="<%= l.used?'0':'1' %>"><button class="button outline small">Mark <%= l.used?'unused':'used' %></button></form></td></tr><% }); %><% if(!leads.length){ %><tr><td colspan="8">No leads found.</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div></div><div class="admin-columns"><section class="panel"><h2>Coupon settings</h2><p>Changes apply to new coupons. Existing coupons keep their original terms. The total allocation stays at 100.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/settings"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><p>New spin awards are randomly selected from ₹100–₹150. Previously issued coupons keep their original amount.</p><label>Validity in days<input type="number" name="validity" value="<%= settings.validity %>" min="1" max="90" required></label><button class="button">Save settings</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Service prices</h2><p>Leave blank to display “Ask us for pricing”.</p><% services.forEach(s=>{ %><form class="price-form" method="post" action="/admin/service/<%= s.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label><%= s.name %><input type="number" name="price" min="0" max="100000" value="<%= s.price??'' %>" aria-label="<%= s.name %> price in rupees"></label><button class="button outline small">Save</button></form><% }); %></section></div><section class="panel"><h2>Manage offers</h2><div class="admin-columns"><% [...offers,{id:'',title:'',description:'',active:1}].forEach(o=>{ %><form class="offer-edit" method="post" action="/admin/offer"><h3><%= o.id?'Edit offer':'Add an offer' %></h3><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= o.id %>"><label>Title<input name="title" value="<%= o.title %>" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" maxlength="600" required><%= o.description %></textarea></label><label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" <%= o.active?'checked':'' %>><span>Active</span></label><button class="button">Save offer</button></form><% }); %></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Salon logo</h2><p>Upload your original PNG, JPG or WebP (up to 5 MB). The original is retained; a display copy removes surrounding white margins. It appears on the website and downloaded coupons.</p><form id="logo-upload"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Original logo<input type="file" name="logo" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" required></label><button class="button" type="submit">Upload logo</button><p id="logo-upload-status" role="status"></p></form></section></section><%- include('footer') %>
